 file in your home directory, it will be read.  Otherwise, a
 system-wide configuration file will be read from
-.IR /etc/xpdf/xpdfrc ,
+.IR /etc/xpdfrc3 ,
 if it exists.  (This is its default location; depending on build
 options, it may be placed elsewhere.)
